### =========================================================================
### PEDIDOS360 BACKEND - KIT DE PRUEBAS REST
### Asignatura: DSY1107 - Desarrollo Cloud Native I
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. CASO PBLICO (200 OK sin autenticacion)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/health
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/productos
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/productos/1
Accept: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. CASO PROTEGIDO SIN TOKEN (Debe retornar 401 Unauthorized)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pedidos
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Accept: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. CASO TOKEN INVLIDO (Debe retornar 401 Unauthorized)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pedidos
Authorization: Bearer token_falso_o_expirado_12345
Accept: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. LLAMADAS CON TOKEN VLIDO (Reemplaza {{token}} con tu token de Azure AD)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_ACCESS_TOKEN_DE_AZURE_AD

### Consultar perfil con token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar pedidos con token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pedidos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear nuevo pedido (Requiere scope 'recurso.write')
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pedidos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteNombre": "Estudiante Duoc",
  "clienteEmail": "estudiante@duocuc.cl",
  "items": [
    { "productoId": 1, "cantidad": 2 },
    { "productoId": 5, "cantidad": 2 }
  ]
}

### Acceso a panel de administrador (Requiere rol 'ADMIN')
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/pedidos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. ADMINISTRACION DE RABBITMQ (Requiere App Role 'ADMIN')
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Consultar estado de conexion y resumen de RabbitMQ
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rabbitmq/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar todas las colas administradas en RabbitMQ
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rabbitmq/queues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Consultar detalle y metricas de la cola principal de pedidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rabbitmq/queues/pedidos.pedido-creado.queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear una nueva cola en RabbitMQ
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rabbitmq/queues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "pedidos.cocina-express.queue",
  "durable": true,
  "exclusive": false,
  "autoDelete": false
}

### Purgar mensajes de una cola
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rabbitmq/queues/pedidos.cocina-express.queue/purge
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Eliminar cola no critica
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rabbitmq/queues/pedidos.cocina-express.queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar todos los exchanges administrados en RabbitMQ
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rabbitmq/exchanges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear un nuevo exchange (direct, topic, fanout o headers)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rabbitmq/exchanges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "pedidos.cocina.exchange",
  "type": "topic",
  "durable": true,
  "autoDelete": false
}

### Listar enlaces (bindings) activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rabbitmq/bindings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear un nuevo enlace (binding) entre cola y exchange
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rabbitmq/bindings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "queueName": "pedidos.pedido-creado.queue",
  "exchangeName": "pedidos.exchange",
  "routingKey": "pedido.prioritario"
}

### Eliminar un enlace (binding)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rabbitmq/bindings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "queueName": "pedidos.pedido-creado.queue",
  "exchangeName": "pedidos.exchange",
  "routingKey": "pedido.prioritario"
}
